      "claim": "The SAARC Fountain is a 1985 steel sculpture by Nitun Kundu (about 9.75 m tall, 32 m diameter) at the intersection of Panthapath, Kazi Nazrul Islam Avenue and Sonargaon Road, beside the Pan Pacific Sonargaon hotel; coordinates 23.749909, 90.393162.",
